# Auto-commit after meaningful work

When the user asks to apply Dvely_FE UI, migrate pages, or otherwise change this repo, commit after each completed unit of work. Do not wait until the entire task is finished.

## When to commit

- After adding a Cursor rule or project convention
- After copying or replacing a coherent UI group (landing, home, project workspace, agent, settings)
- After wiring dummy APIs for a domain
- After a typecheck/build fix that unblocks the next step

## How

- Follow the repo git commit protocol (status, diff, log, HEREDOC message)
- Commit only relevant source files, not `.env` or secrets
- Use short Korean or English messages that say why, not a file list
- Do not push unless the user asks
